Bundle-Description: Creates a Liferay MVC portlet as a module project with Jakarta compatibility.
Bundle-Name: Liferay Project Templates MVC Portlet Jakarta
Bundle-SymbolicName: com.liferay.project.templates.mvc.portlet.jakarta
Bundle-Version: 1.0.0
Liferay-Versions: [7,9999.0)
-removeheaders:\
	Import-Package,\
	Private-Package,\
	Require-Capability